  "description": "Functional programming library for .NET with Option, Result, Validation, Try, RemoteData, NonEmptyList, Writer, Reader, State, and IO monads. Features async/await support with CancellationToken, LINQ query syntax, zero dependencies on .NET 6+ (minimal polyfills on netstandard2.x), Roslyn analyzers, source generators for discriminated unions, ASP.NET Core and EF Core integrations.",
